From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:29:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! fonts: Only load @font-face fonts that the page uses

Two of upstream's MathML reftests, mo-lspace-rspace-dynamic and
operator-dictionary-empty-and-three-chars, pass on plain upstream and
fail with this patch. Their screenshots differ from the references only
in the red square that `ensure_for_match_reftest("has_operator_spacing")`
of mathml/support/feature-detection.js adds when it measures no operator
spacing, which Servo doesn't implement. Why the check passes on plain
upstream wasn't traced. In CI, operator-dictionary-empty-and-three-chars
fails on plain upstream too.

Validation: `./mach test-wpt --processes 8 --timeout-multiplier 2 mathml` with release builds: both tests pass with the stack up to the previous patch and fail from this one on, with SpiderMonkey and QuickJS. With these expectations, the ohos-main tip has no unexpected result for them.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; bisected and written by the agent)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 .../operators/mo-lspace-rspace-dynamic.html.ini                 | 2 ++
 .../operator-dictionary-empty-and-three-chars.html.ini          | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tests/wpt/meta/mathml/presentation-markup/operators/mo-lspace-rspace-dynamic.html.ini
 create mode 100644 tests/wpt/meta/mathml/presentation-markup/operators/operator-dictionary-empty-and-three-chars.html.ini

diff --git a/tests/wpt/meta/mathml/presentation-markup/operators/mo-lspace-rspace-dynamic.html.ini b/tests/wpt/meta/mathml/presentation-markup/operators/mo-lspace-rspace-dynamic.html.ini
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..e6296d8a13f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/wpt/meta/mathml/presentation-markup/operators/mo-lspace-rspace-dynamic.html.ini
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+[mo-lspace-rspace-dynamic.html]
+  expected: FAIL
diff --git a/tests/wpt/meta/mathml/presentation-markup/operators/operator-dictionary-empty-and-three-chars.html.ini b/tests/wpt/meta/mathml/presentation-markup/operators/operator-dictionary-empty-and-three-chars.html.ini
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..00538c38e67
